---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Contact | SEC-Hub"
	description="Email the SEC-Hub team to request a demo, discuss your project or ask about the systems engineering software platform."
>
	<main>
		<section class="bg-slate-50">
			<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 md:px-10 md:py-24">
				<p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide border-l-2 border-accent pl-3 text-primary">Contact SEC-Hub</p>
				<h1 class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-primary sm:text-5xl">
					Let’s talk about your systems engineering work
				</h1>
				<p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
					Have a question, want to explore the workspace, or interested in a demo?
					Email our team to arrange a walkthrough or talk through what you need.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section aria-labelledby="contact-details-title" class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-12 px-6 py-16 md:px-10 md:py-20 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_20rem] lg:gap-20">
			<div>
				<h2 id="contact-details-title" class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-950 sm:text-3xl">
					See SEC-Hub in action
				</h2>
				<p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
					Explore how SEC-Hub brings system structures, reference designations
					and interfaces together in one shared workspace. Tell us a little about
					your project so we can focus the demo on what matters to your team.
				</p>
				<a
					href="mailto:info@syseng.dk?subject=SEC-Hub%20demo%20request"
					aria-describedby="email-app-note"
					class="mt-8 inline-flex rounded-md bg-primary px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-primary/90 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-primary"
				>
					Request a demo by email
				</a>
				<p id="email-app-note" class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500">
					Opens your email app with the recipient and subject filled in.
				</p>
				<div class="mt-8 border-t border-slate-200 pt-6">
					<p class="text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
						Have a different question? Email us directly:
					</p>
					<p class="mt-2 w-fit select-all text-lg font-medium text-slate-950">info@syseng.dk</p>
					<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500">
						Select and copy the address into your preferred email service.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<aside class="h-fit rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-6 sm:p-8">
				<h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-950">A helpful starting point</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
					You don’t need a detailed brief. A few lines about the following will help us understand your needs:
				</p>
				<ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-3 pl-5 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
					<li>Your team and the systems you work with</li>
					<li>The challenges you’re looking to solve</li>
					<li>What you’d like to explore in a demo</li>
				</ul>
				<div class="mt-6 border-t border-slate-200 pt-6">
					<p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-950">Not ready for a demo?</p>
					<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
						We’re also happy to discuss product questions, pricing and whether SEC-Hub fits your project.
					</p>
				</div>
			</aside>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
